WEBVTT

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:07.510
Toshiya, you're applying
to the Gunpla Academy?

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.980
You're really good at Gunpla,
so you're sure to get in.

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:15.730
Hey, if you meet Meijin Kawaguchi,
please get me his autograph!

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.270
<i>Of we three triplets,</i>

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:22.070
<i>I was the best at building Gunpla.</i>

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:25.740
<i>I even entered the
Under-13 Championship...</i>

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:29.280
<i>And I made it to the National
Tournament two years in a row.</i>

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:33.120
<i>I was going to enter
the Gunpla Academy...</i>

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.960
<i>...and aim for a higher level.</i>

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:38.460
<i>I figured it was just a matter of course.</i>

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:41.210
<i>But...</i>

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:44.880
Gunpla Academy Enrollment Selection

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:48.050
Rejected? Why would Toshi be...?

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:49.760
There must be some mistake.

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:52.640
Kazu, let's go ask
the Gunpla Academy!

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:53.230
Yeah.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:54.180
Stop it!

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:58.900
<i>My admiration for
the Gunpla Academy...</i>

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:02.570
<i>...changed to hatred
in an instant.</i>

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:06.990
<i>I won't forgive those who
didn't acknowledge me.</i>

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:11.700
<i>My talent and my strength...</i>

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:14.080
<i>I'll show them all!</i>

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:39.100
<i>Our wings couldn't wait for the wind, so we set out</i>

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:44.610
<i>We were bathed in the light of the frozen sun</i>

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:47.360
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh there are no limits</i>

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:50.120
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh just let it go</i>

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:55.660
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh loneliness won't break us</i>

00:01:57.460 --> 00:02:00.210
<i>At the end of the dream we'll never give up,</i>

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Will there be a future that can never end?</i>

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:08.430
<i>Believe in what only you can do</i>

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:11.140
<i>If I could seize one thing,</i>

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:13.850
<i>I'd choose it without hesitation</i>

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:19.140
<i>Follow your instincts, just hold on to our bond</i>

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:25.690
Up to the endless sky, now! Fly away

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:47.050
<i>GUNDAM BUILD FIGHTERS TRY</i>

00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:52.340
Since Granada Academy is
participating as a seed,

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:54.350
our first battle will be
in the second round.

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:58.100
This time, we've added
a new team member,

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:00.310
drastically increasing
our fighting strength.

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:03.270
Please support us.

00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:07.360
That was our interview
with Coach Suriga,

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:10.490
from the third-seeded
Granada Academy.

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:12.320
Yes, that's a wrap.

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:15.240
Thank you very much, Coach.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:16.030
Not at all.

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:17.790
Miss Mirai.

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:20.000
That's it for today,

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:22.420
so you can go and
cheer for your brother.

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:24.580
Thank you, Ms. Hibiki!

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:28.880
Your brother's in this tournament?

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:29.970
Yes.

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:33.430
He's in a team called Try Fighters
from Seiho Academy.

00:03:33.970 --> 00:03:35.300
Excuse me.

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.640
Try Fighters...

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:42.600
ls that the team coached
by Lieutenant Ral?

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:46.190
I think in the second round,

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:48.980
they're facing Niigata's
Toritsu Academy.

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:52.150
What's this atmosphere...?

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:57.120
The venue has gone silent.

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:05.000
What's going on?

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:09.460
Wh-What's that Gunpla?!

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:16.720
It's like... a three-headed... dragon.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:23.020
I can't lose in the second round.

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:28.110
Not until I defeat
the Gunpla Academy.

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:33.240
Until I... We...

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:35.320
...have proven our strength!

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:40.490
Episode 18
Snibal-Drago-Gira

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:50.420
<i>Particle supply, stability confirmed.</i>

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:53.550
<i>Output increased to 270. We can go!</i>

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:56.130
Nobu, Kazu, commence attack!

00:04:56.220 --> 00:04:56.930
Roger!
Roger!

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:00.560
<i>The dragon's mouth!</i>

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:01.720
Run!

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:15.320
Why so many particles?!

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:18.410
They're using the particles
they absorbed for this attack!

00:05:18.570 --> 00:05:19.570
Darn it!

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:20.580
<i>Sekai!</i>

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:28.330
My attack didn't work!

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:29.580
<i>A particle shield?!</i>

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:32.130
We're at a disadvantage
in tight spaces.

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:33.050
Let's get out!

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:36.510
<i>There's only the narrow
passage you came through.</i>

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.350
<i>No way...</i>

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:44.980
We won't let you go.

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:04.410
At this rate...

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:05.700
We'll get beaten.

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:08.960
Hoshino, take Yuuma
with you and follow me.

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:10.040
Sekai?!

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:12.130
It's time to get a little rough!

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:26.430
No, Sekai!

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:31.190
That's Assimilation, which
unifies the fighter and the Gunpla.

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:34.400
But if you use it while
you're under attack...

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:38.570
Thanks to the nocebo effect,
any damage to the Gunpla...

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:41.360
...will be reflected in
the fighter's body.

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:45.740
Even... so!

00:06:57.010 --> 00:06:57.960
With brute force?!

00:06:58.300 --> 00:06:59.510
He tore it down!

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:03.140
Jigen Haoh School!

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:10.020
<i>(Blue Sky Crimson Fist)
Soten Guren-Ken!</i>

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:14.650
You're defenseless!

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:22.320
Ha! You can't protect
yourself with that!

00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:23.740
<i>Sekai!</i>

00:07:27.330 --> 00:07:27.990
What?!

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:30.330
You're always so reckless!

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:37.500
And I'm aware of that!

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:43.260
What?!

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:46.720
Yuu!

00:07:46.850 --> 00:07:47.930
I know!

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:09.870
What?

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:11.410
Toshi, the castle's collapsing!

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:12.540
We'll be squashed!

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:13.580
No way!

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:39.190
D-Did we get them?

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:41.070
Sekai and the others won!

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:41.730
Right.

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:43.070
No.

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:44.200
Not yet!

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:49.740
<i>With such attacks...</i>

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:55.920
<i>...there's no way you can
defeat our Snibal-Drago-Gira!</i>

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:00.670
Impossible! They're unscathed?!

00:09:01.050 --> 00:09:02.210
Then, with this...!

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:06.470
Jigen Haoh School!

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:13.390
<i>(Shooting Star Spiral Fist)
Ryusei Rasen-Ken!</i>

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:20.360
I can't get through!

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:22.820
Because we absorbed your particles.

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:24.900
Your particle emission is weak!

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:39.170
<i>Sekai!</i>

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:40.460
Sekai's Gunpla is...!

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:43.500
<i>Sekai, are you okay?!</i>

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:48.220
Now the Try Burning is useless.

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:50.800
That just leaves the SD...

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:52.510
<i>...and that critically-damaged machine.</i>

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:53.600
Let's finish them!

00:09:57.480 --> 00:09:59.020
Hoshino, please run.

00:09:59.020 --> 00:09:59.560
But-

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:01.150
Run, Fumi!

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:03.610
This is the end.

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:12.330
Huh?!

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:13.330
What?
Huh?!

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:15.330
HOW?

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:18.290
How... How can he stand up?

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:28.340
The backlash from the Assimilation...

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:30.510
...should have damaged his body.

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:33.050
How can he stand up?

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:36.020
<i>When I studied with my master,</i>

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:39.440
<i>I trained myself to the limit.</i>

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:43.230
<i>Besides...</i>

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:47.190
<i>Through your fist,
I heard your soul.</i>

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:51.030
<i>What are you so vengeful about?</i>

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:55.290
ls it fun to battle, feeling like that?

00:10:56.120 --> 00:11:00.870
<i>Gunpla battle should be played
joyfully and in earnest, right?</i>

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:03.250
<i>Isn't that right?</i>

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:05.090
Don't you lecture me!

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:17.060
He's using the Burning
Burst at a time like this?

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:17.680
That's crazy!

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:18.140
<i>I'll</i> open up a path!
That's crazy!

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:19.680
I'll open up a patch!

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:20.640
Sekai...

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:21.600
<i>Yuuma.</i>

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:23.020
<i>Hoshino.</i>

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:24.560
<i>I'll leave the rest to you.</i>

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:25.570
<i>Sekai!</i>

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:28.150
All right, here we go. Take this!

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:33.950
<i>The Try Burning and I
achieved this together...</i>

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:38.580
We made this technique!

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:07.730
Yuuma.

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:09.230
Hoshino.

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:11.070
They're all yours...

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:16.070
Sekai, we'll take it from here!

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:17.330
<i>Leave it to me!</i>

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:20.790
The path Sekai made for us...

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:24.500
It's our Winning Road!

00:12:49.020 --> 00:12:51.110
<i>Real Mode</i>

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:53.030
A-A Real Type...?!
A-A Real Type...?!

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:54.740
It transformed!
It transformed!

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:57.280
All generators connected.

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:05.120
<i>Full mode!</i>

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:08.880
Winning...

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:10.920
...Beam!

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:20.720
<i>Tosh“.</i>

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:21.560
The machine control!

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:29.650
I'll put all my remaining particles
into this one attack!

00:13:32.190 --> 00:13:33.230
That's it!

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:44.120
<i>Th-This will...</i>

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:46.580
No. It's not over yet!

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:50.750
<i>Not until I beat the Gunpla Academy!</i>

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:54.090
<i>Not until I settle my grudge!</i>

00:13:58.090 --> 00:14:01.510
If you're fighting with hatred,

00:14:02.140 --> 00:14:04.600
then we'll fight with joy!

00:14:05.480 --> 00:14:07.060
Shut up!

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:24.580
<i>Because...</i>

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:28.790
Because...

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:32.460
Because we love Gunpla Battle.

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:51.650
<i>It's the same with me...</i>

00:14:52.610 --> 00:14:53.310
<i>Even me...</i>

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:11.080
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:13.580
<i>The winner of match six is
Seiho Academy Middle School,</i>

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:15.420
<i>All right!</i>
<i>The winner of match six is
Seiho Academy Middle School,</i>

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:16.130
<i>The winner of match six is
Seiho Academy Middle School,</i>

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:18.210
<i>team Try Fighters!</i>

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:22.010
Guys, congratulations!

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:23.970
Sekai.

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:27.390
<i>Sekai!</i>

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:29.930
Hurry! Take Sekai to the infirmary!

00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:30.520
Yes, sir!
Yes, sir!

00:15:31.350 --> 00:15:33.690
What happened to Sekai?

00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:35.820
Did he get too psyched up?

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:38.690
A technique I don't know.

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:41.740
Did the master pass on
the innermost mystery?

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:45.530
Not to me, but to Sekai?

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:54.880
Toshi...

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:06.390
I don't know why you weren't
accepted by the Gunpla Academy.

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:11.140
Wilfrid...

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:12.270
...Kijima.

00:16:13.690 --> 00:16:15.560
That was a superb Gunpla.

00:16:16.360 --> 00:16:20.230
I was hoping we'd get to fight...
I really wanted to play against you directly.

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:23.320
To fight a pure battle with you,

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:26.570
without any ill feelings.

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:35.210
Thanks, that helps.

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:43.590
I don't want you to hate Gunpla.

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:48.640
If I didn't like it...

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:51.770
...l wouldn't feel this disappointed.

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:13.080
I could defeat them
in under a minute.

00:17:14.210 --> 00:17:17.710
We'll get through this round
with our current strength.

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:21.210
I'll keep you in reserve until
we fight the Gunpla Academy.

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:25.800
When we fight the Gunpla Academy,
can I do as I please?

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:28.300
That's fine. I'll leave it to you.

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:30.430
Thanks.

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:32.350
Infirmary

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:36.640
Same as usual.

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:40.270
He'll recover after
he rests for a while.

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:44.990
I always make Sekai overdo it.

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:51.120
No matter how much we try
to stop him, he'll keep on doing it.

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:56.660
Nobody makes him do it.
He chooses it for himself.

00:17:57.750 --> 00:18:02.340
Because no matter what,
our ace is stupid and stubborn.

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:05.260
That's right.

00:18:06.090 --> 00:18:08.090
Hoshino, please watch over Sekai.

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:11.680
I'm going back to my room
to start fixing our Gunpla.

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:12.470
Right.

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:17.180
I'll come and help later.

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:18.100
Thanks.

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:27.530
Hey...

00:18:29.530 --> 00:18:30.610
You are...

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:34.580
ls Sekai alright?

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:39.250
Don't worry. He'll be okay
after he rests for a while.

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:40.580
That's a relief.

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:43.040
That...

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:46.460
That beautiful SD. Did you build it?

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:49.680
You mean the Star Winning?

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:51.010
Yes, I did.

00:18:52.720 --> 00:18:54.600
That's a relief, too.

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:58.060
What do you mean?

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:03.360
With you, I think I can
have a great battle.

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:14.580
<i>MY Lightning...</i>

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:18.750
<i>Since I built spare parts,
I can fix it easily.</i>

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:23.250
<i>But the Try Burning...</i>

00:19:23.630 --> 00:19:28.050
<i>It's a Gunpla built by Mr. Sei Lori,
the former world champion.</i>

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:33.050
<i>Of course, I can fix it
before the third round.</i>

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:35.010
<i>But...</i>

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:37.100
<i>I'm not sure I have the ability...</i>

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:40.520
<i>...to restore the Try Burning
to its original strength.</i>

00:19:46.270 --> 00:19:47.900
What's up, Sis?

00:19:50.570 --> 00:19:53.610
What? You're here in Japan?

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:55.830
Aren't you running
an exhibition in Paris?

00:19:55.830 --> 00:19:59.750
<i>Yes, so I have to return right away.</i>

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:01.410
Then why...?

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:02.330
<i>Actually...</i>

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:05.580
<i>Sei asked me to do him a favor.</i>

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:19.520
Yuu!

00:20:22.100 --> 00:20:23.850
Long time no see, You.

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:29.980
What did Mr. Sei ask you to do?

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:33.530
He asked me to give this to you.

00:20:37.030 --> 00:20:38.120
These are...

00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:42.040
...spare parts for the Build Burning!

00:20:43.460 --> 00:20:46.000
Mr. Sei wants me to have these?

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:49.710
Sei asked me to deliver a message, too.

00:20:53.970 --> 00:20:58.050
The Build Burning was made
for his precious best friend.

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:02.060
It was customized so that
his friend would find it easy to use.

00:21:04.020 --> 00:21:06.850
He had sealed it away,
along with his memories.

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:11.440
But when he saw it moving,
he was very happy.

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:19.410
It would seem his friend and Kamiki
both have similar fighting styles.

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:25.660
You...

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:29.000
Tell Sekai Kamiki.

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:32.250
"The Build Burning..."

00:21:33.260 --> 00:21:35.170
"...is your Gunpla now."

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:43.270
"So, someday,"

00:21:44.390 --> 00:21:47.100
"let's play Gunpla Battle together!"

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:01.870
<i>There's a tomorrow I want to touch</i>

00:22:01.870 --> 00:22:05.250
<i>I want to prove it for myself</i>

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:10.040
<i>Love, hate, which is it?</i>

00:22:10.790 --> 00:22:13.880
<i>Perhaps the challenge is in the journey</i>

00:22:13.880 --> 00:22:16.970
<i>Wandering the unknown path...</i>

00:22:16.970 --> 00:22:23.720
<i>...toward abundant happiness</i>

00:22:25.470 --> 00:22:28.480
<i>I was afraid to run</i>

00:22:28.480 --> 00:22:31.860
<i>But now that I've started, I can't stop</i>

00:22:31.860 --> 00:22:34.650
<i>I must've been waiting for the go sign</i>

00:22:34.650 --> 00:22:38.490
<i>With this passion in my impatient heart,</i>

00:22:38.490 --> 00:22:43.160
<i>I want to search for something</i>

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:47.910
<i>Let's meet over and over again (with you)</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:50.210
<i>On this journey, can you show me...</i>

00:22:50.210 --> 00:22:55.250
...a <i>different truth? (let me see)</i>

00:22:55.250 --> 00:23:02.180
<i>The power to find new things (with me)</i>

00:23:02.180 --> 00:23:05.760
<i>Never forget it</i>

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:08.060
<i>Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:23:08.060 --> 00:23:08.600
<i>(Today)
Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:23:08.600 --> 00:23:10.230
<i>(Today)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:23:10.230 --> 00:23:11.100
<i>(I'll be there...)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:23:11.100 --> 00:23:14.110
<i>(I'll be there...)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:23:14.110 --> 00:23:16.480
<i>(Alive!)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:23:16.480 --> 00:23:17.440
<i>(Alive!)</i>

00:23:17.480 --> 00:23:23.370
Team Try Fighters!

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:29.710
<i>With these, I can restore the
Try Burning to perfect condition.</i>

00:23:30.330 --> 00:23:31.540
<i>Wait for it, Sekai!</i>

00:23:40.050 --> 00:23:41.050
What do you want?

00:23:41.630 --> 00:23:43.970
Give us the thing you're holding.

00:23:44.970 --> 00:23:45.550
Why?

00:23:45.640 --> 00:23:47.100
Just give it to us!

00:23:47.180 --> 00:23:48.180
I refuse.

00:23:48.270 --> 00:23:50.060
Should we do it the hard way?

00:23:51.060 --> 00:23:54.730
To be honest, I'm no good at fighting.

00:23:54.980 --> 00:23:56.980
But even so, I won't...

00:23:57.650 --> 00:24:00.110
I won't let you have this!

00:24:00.690 --> 00:24:02.990
Among the teams we'll
face in the quarterfinals,

00:24:02.990 --> 00:24:05.410
there's an opponent who uses
the same martial art as Sekai.

00:24:05.410 --> 00:24:06.120
Next episode, "Fateful Reunion".

00:24:06.120 --> 00:24:07.370
Fateful Reunion
Next episode, "Fateful Reunion".

00:24:07.370 --> 00:24:10.080
Fateful Reunion
